  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Now solution is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Also given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp; Number of points of intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is zero.</p></blockquote>",
